{"id": "85912", "name": "הצבה u=cos(x) – e^cos(x)·sin(x) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Using the substitution \\(u = \\cos({{CT:0}})\\) integrate {{CT:1}} with respect to {{CT:2}}.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Substitute \\(u=\\cos({{CT:0}})\\), integrate \\(e^u\\) and substitute back.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The substitution</b><br><p>We are told to use the substitution \\(u=\\cos({{CT:0}})\\), so we therefore get \\(du = -\\sin({{CT:0}})\\,d{{CT:0}}\\). Hence:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ d{{CT:0}} = -\\frac{du}{\\sin({{CT:0}})}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Integrate and substitute back</b><br><p>So the integral becomes:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int {{CT:3}}\\,d{{CT:0}} &= \\int e^u \\cdot \\sin({{CT:0}}) \\cdot \\left(-\\frac{du}{\\sin({{CT:0}})}\\right) \\\\ &= - \\int e^u \\,du \\\\ &= -e^u + c \\\\ &= -e^{\\cos({{CT:0}})} + c \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Int", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "INT-SUB-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "INT-SUB-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "ta", "u", "v"], "nvariants": 3}